## .NET build output — generated, must never be committed.
## These folders were tracked earlier, which is why every merge produced
## conflict markers INSIDE generated files (MSB3541 "Files has invalid value
## <<<<<<< HEAD") and broke the build until they were deleted by hand.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

## Visual Studio / Rider local state
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Publish / packaging
[Pp]ublish/
*.publishsettings
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

## Logs & local artifacts
[Ll]ogs/
*.log

## Local secrets — never commit connection strings
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
